<title>CHINA: China January rubber imports soar 120.4 pct.</title>
<headline>China January rubber imports soar 120.4 pct.</headline>
<dateline>BEIJING 1997-02-25</dateline>
<text>
<p>China imported 50,000 tonnes of natural rubber, including latex, in January, up 120.4 percent from the same period of 1996, customs figures showed on Tuesday.</p>
<p>Imports of natural rubber, including latex, were 550,000 tonnes in 1996, up 72.1 percent from 1995.</p>
<p>Imports of synthetic rubber, including latex, in January were 29,343 tonnes, up 13.2 percent from the same 1996 period while imports in 1996 were 367,456 tonnes, a rise of 17.9 percent from 1995.</p>
<p>-- Beijing newsroom (8610) 6532 1921</p>
</text>
